#bower_components/

# RIA/Silverlight projects
Generated_Code/

# Backup & report files from converting an old project file
_UpgradeReport_Files/
Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.XML
UpgradeLog*.htm
ServiceFabricBackup/
*.rptproj.bak

# SQL Server files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

